{
  "subject": "zone_archive_catalog",
  "area": "world",
  "claim": "In the reference r806919.Wizard_1_610 install, whose Data/GameData holds 3,589 archives, each of the 3,348 zones with placed objects takes templates for them from Root.wad, and 136 of those zones, in 23 worlds, also take templates from their own world's WorldData archive, named <world>-WorldData.wad, as draws_from lists; no placed object's template is in any other archive.",
  "revision": "r806919.Wizard_1_610",
  "method": "static",
  "how_to_repeat": [
    "Read Bin/revision.dat from your own install and confirm it reports r806919.Wizard_1_610.",
    "Run python contrib/tools/ambrose-zone-catalog/catalog.py --extractor <built extractor> --client <your install> --type-dump <your matching type dump> --draws-from --client-tool <built client> and compare its totals, draws_from and worlds with the ones here.",
    "The tool joins the template_id of each zone_object row the extractor writes with the archive that client template --list gives for that id; check two rows by hand by running the extractor with --sql <file> zones, taking the template ids of the zone_object rows of WizardCity/WC_Hub and Krokotopia/KT_Hub, and looking each up with client template <id>."
  ],
  "evidence": [
    "On the reference install the extractor read 3,356 zones from 3,589 archives and 67,325 placed objects in 3,348 of them, and client template --list listed 137,423 templates in 27 archives with none naming an entry the install lacks.",
    "Every placed object names a template the manifest lists: 66,660 are in Root.wad and 665 are in 23 WorldData archives, each the WorldData archive of the object's own world; no object lacks a template and none names one the manifest does not list.",
    "WizardCity/WC_Hub takes one object's template from WizardCity-WorldData.wad and Krokotopia/KT_Hub takes three from Krokotopia-WorldData.wad, and a join written separately over the same extractor output and template listing gave the same 136 rows.",
    "The eight zones with no placed objects are Housing_SP_FlatIsland/House_SP_FlatIsland_Int_Preview, Housing_SteamSkyCastle/SteamSkyCastlePreview_Int, Housing_Wallaru_Ranch/Wallaru_Ranch_Int_Preview, Test/Sound_Test, ThePhantomZoneWorld/ThePhantomZone, ThePhantomZoneWorld/ThePhantomZone_Green, ThePhantomZoneWorld/WebGameLobby and WizardCity/Interiors/WC_Fishing_CE_01.",
    "Of the manifest's 27 template archives, three hold no placed object's template: Housing_Gauntlet_Forbidden_Library-WorldData.wad, Recipes-WorldData.wad and _Shared-WorldData.wad.",
    "The submitter's install of the same revision holds ten more archives and 3,366 zones, as contrib/findings/world/zone_catalog.json records, and there every zone's gamedata.bin was in the archive its path names; the templates its placed objects take were not counted there."
  ],
  "disproof": "A placed object in the reference install whose template the manifest puts in an archive other than Root.wad or its own world's WorldData archive, a zone with placed objects that takes no template from Root.wad, or a repeat of the join that gives a different row or count in draws_from, worlds or totals would disprove this table.",
  "confidence": "high",
