  "scope_note": "Counts are the reference install's. A zone entry draws on its own zone-data archive, which contrib/findings/world/zone_catalog.json names, on Root.wad, and for the zones draws_from lists on their world's WorldData archive. Only the templates placed objects name are followed, through TemplateManifest.xml; the models, textures, sounds and other files the zone and those templates name are not resolved to archives, so an archive holding only such files is not listed.",
